|YKB'The core of a man's body is well protected by bone and muscle.
Both can be broken.'|WKO - |RKBGrand Master Maelstrom|YK0

A Monk of this level of mastery has developed this formidable
attack skill with their walking stick. The Monk utilizes the
walking stick like a pole vault, lifting them above and behind
the target. This places the Monk behind their foe to crack
their skull with a mighty blow.

|WKBThis is a Master of Winter power.

